    "group": "Hearthfyre Arsenal",
    "summary": "At the close of your Command phase, gain 1 YP per objective you control outside your deployment zone with a friendly IRON-MASTER or MEMNYR STRATEGIST model in range. This yield caps at 2 YP per turn. You may spend 1 YP in your Shooting phase whenever you pick a unit with BRÔKHYR, ARKANYST EVALUATOR or IRONKIN STEELJACKS to fire. That unit’s models can re-roll Hit results of 1 for the remainder of the phase.",
